      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "こっちは別の兵士に任せて、\r\n俺たちは陛下のもとへ急ごう！",
        "official_en": "Leave this to the rank and file—we must hurry on to His Majesty!",
        "real_en": "Let's leave this to the other soldiers and hurry to His Majesty!"
