      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "エマとの約束を忘れたのか？\r\nまずはナシャトの町に行って\r\nエマの伯母さんに許しをもらわないとな。",
        "official_en": "Have you forgotten our promise to Emma? We must make for Felicitas and get permission from her aunt.",
        "real_en": "Have you forgotten our promise to Emma? First, we need to go to Felicitas and get her aunt’s permission."
      },
