        "official_en_sha256": "b1e2cd181a27be9094bf127ac86c3663aac0c335621e73dfd8e2aef04909618e"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "城に戻りたい気持ちはわかる。\r\nだが、先にミトラの町へ向かってくれ。",
        "official_en": "I want to return to the castle just as much as you do. But first, we have business in Mitra.",
        "real_en": "I know you want to return to the castle.\nBut please head to Mitra first."
