      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "理由は後で話す。\r\nだからいまは、ミトラの町へ急ぐぞ。",
        "official_en": "We must hurry on to Mitra. I’ll explain everything once we’re there.",
        "real_en": "I'll explain why later.\nFor now, let's hurry to Mitra."
